pane was written from scratch. While building it, the author studied other macOS window managers. A few small idioms
came from MIT-licensed projects, and their notices follow:

- Rectangle (https://github.com/rxhanson/Rectangle): comparing window rectangles with a tolerance.
- ClickThrough by Pirouz Ruppert (https://github.com/PirouzSR/ClickThrough): the window-list call that finds the window
  under the pointer.
- SaneBar (https://github.com/sane-apps/SaneBar): centring a window on the screen.

